{"id":"c36cc156fef49a61","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md","title":"Semialgebraic Set","display":"df-semialgebraic-set — Semialgebraic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semialgebraic-set","aliases":["58-df-semialgebraic-set","Semialgebraic Set"],"display":"df-semialgebraic-set — Semialgebraic Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-polynomial]]","[[58-df-real-closed]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-interior]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semialgebraic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semialgebraic-set</span><span>Semialgebraic Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semialgebraic-set — Semialgebraic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00787d1ad50fa75c\" href=\"?note=00787d1ad50fa75c\" title=\"58-df-real-closed\">58-df-real-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3df866ee4574e842\" href=\"?note=3df866ee4574e842\" title=\"58-df-interior\">58-df-interior</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CoordinateProjection}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{CoordinateProjection}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RealClosedField}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{RealClosedField}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{6}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SemialgebraicDimension}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{SemialgebraicDimension}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TarskiSeidenberg}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{TarskiSeidenberg}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\">\\((R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\)</span> (real closed ordered field)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S \\subseteq R^n\">\\(S \\subseteq R^n\\)</span> (subset)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\omega\">\\(n \\in \\omega\\)</span> (dimension)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{ij}\">\\(p_{ij}\\)</span> (polynomials in the finite disjunctive normal form)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r, s_i\">\\(r, s_i\\)</span> (indices for the decomposition)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> (projection map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (algebraic set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\">\\(\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\)</span> is imported from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"00787d1ad50fa75c\" href=\"?note=00787d1ad50fa75c\" title=\"58-df-real-closed\">58-df-real-closed</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\">\\(\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\)</span> is the structure-explicit predicate defined here using the registered polynomial degree and evaluation relations</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S\\)</span> (semialgebraic predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S\\)</span> is the coordinate-subselection predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;\\bigl(0_R&lt;_{R}a\\to\n\\exists b\\in R\\;(\\cdot_R(b,b)=a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\n\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(d=2k+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{67pt}\\to\\exists r,y\\in R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(y,f,\\langle r\\rangle,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\n\\land y=0_R\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;\\bigl(0_R&lt;_{R}a\\to\n\\exists b\\in R\\;(\\cdot_R(b,b)=a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\n\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(d=2k+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{67pt}\\to\\exists r,y\\in R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(y,f,\\langle r\\rangle,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\n\\land y=0_R\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coordinate\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,d,J)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;d,n\\in\\omega\\land d\\leq n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(J,d,n)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in d\\;(i&lt;j\\to J(i)&lt;J(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\pi,R^n,R^d)\n\\land\\forall x\\in R^n\\;\\forall i&lt;d\\;(\\pi(x)(i)=x(J(i))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coordinate\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,d,J)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;d,n\\in\\omega\\land d\\leq n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(J,d,n)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in d\\;(i&lt;j\\to J(i)&lt;J(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\pi,R^n,R^d)\n\\land\\forall x\\in R^n\\;\\forall i&lt;d\\;(\\pi(x)(i)=x(J(i))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\land S\\subseteq R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega^r\\;\\exists P,D,p,\\epsilon\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land D=\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle:i&lt;r\\land j&lt;s(i)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,D,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\epsilon,D,3)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land S=\\bigcup_{i&lt;r}\\bigcap_{j&lt;s(i)}\n\\left\\{x\\in R^n:\\exists y\\in R\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\n(y,p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),x,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\Bigl(\n(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=0\\land y=0_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1\\land y&lt;_{R}0_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=2\\land0_R&lt;_{R}y)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\land S\\subseteq R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega^r\\;\\exists P,D,p,\\epsilon\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land D=\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle:i&lt;r\\land j&lt;s(i)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,D,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\epsilon,D,3)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land S=\\bigcup_{i&lt;r}\\bigcap_{j&lt;s(i)}\n\\left\\{x\\in R^n:\\exists y\\in R\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\n(y,p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),x,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&amp;\\Bigl(\n(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=0\\land y=0_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1\\land y&lt;_{R}0_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=2\\land0_R&lt;_{R}y)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}seidenberg}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TarskiSeidenberg}_S(\\pi,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n+1,n,J)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(J(i)=i)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\subseteq R^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\to\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(\\pi[A],R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}seidenberg}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TarskiSeidenberg}_S(\\pi,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n+1,n,J)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;(J(i)=i)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\subseteq R^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\to\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(\\pi[A],R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed\\text{-}field\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RealClosedField}_S(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed\\text{-}field\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RealClosedField}_S(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coordinate\\text{-}projection\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,n,d,J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;X=R^n\\land Y=R^d\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,d,J)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coordinate\\text{-}projection\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,n,d,J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;X=R^n\\land Y=R^d\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,d,J)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S\n(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S\n(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SemialgebraicDimension}_S(d,S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d=\\max\\Bigl\\{k\\leq n:\\exists\\pi,J\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,k,J)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{120pt}\\land\n\\operatorname{int}^{R^k}_{\\tau_{R^k}}(\\pi[S])\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SemialgebraicDimension}_S(d,S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,&lt;_{R},n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d=\\max\\Bigl\\{k\\leq n:\\exists\\pi,J\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,k,J)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{120pt}\\land\n\\operatorname{int}^{R^k}_{\\tau_{R^k}}(\\pi[S])\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ordered-field operations, order, polynomial structure, projection coordinates and dimension value are all explicit arguments or witnesses; the former unary real-closed predicate and ambient-space-as-topology call have been removed.</li>\n<li>Semialgebraic: finite Boolean combinations of polynomial equations and strict inequalities</li>\n<li>Tarski--Seidenberg applies to coordinate projections (and their compositions), not to arbitrary functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{n+1}\\to R^n\">\\(R^{n+1}\\to R^n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Tarski-Seidenberg principle: projections of semialgebraic sets are semialgebraic</li>\n<li>Quantifier elimination: any semialgebraic definable set has quantifier-free description</li>\n<li>The semialgebraic subsets form the o-minimal structure of a real closed field; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{\\mathrm{an}}\">\\(\\mathbb R_{\\mathrm{an}}\\)</span> is a different, richer o-minimal expansion.</li>\n<li>Coefficient lookup and point evaluation are now distinct: every sign test is mediated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\)</span>.  The three-place legacy predicates are retained as existential projections for read-only downstream atoms; structure-sensitive new work should use the explicit five-, six-, and eight-place relations.</li>\n<li>Cell decomposition: any semialgebraic set admits stratification into contractible cells</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bochnak, Coste and Roy, Real Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Benedetti and Risler, Real Algebraic and Semialgebraic Sets</li>\n<li>van den Dries, Tame Topology and O-minimal Structures</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-real-closed","status":"resolved","id":"00787d1ad50fa75c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-real-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-interior","status":"resolved","id":"3df866ee4574e842","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-interior]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-real-closed","status":"resolved","id":"00787d1ad50fa75c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})$ is imported from [[58-df-real-closed]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{CoordinateProjection}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RealClosedField}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{8}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S\\subseteq V^{7}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{6}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S\\subseteq V^{8}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SemialgebraicDimension}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TarskiSeidenberg}_S\\subseteq V^{8}","display":false},{"tex":"(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})","display":false},{"tex":"S \\subseteq R^n","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in \\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p_{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"r, s_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{OrderedField}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in R\\;\\bigl(0_R<_{R}a\\to\n\\exists b\\in R\\;(\\cdot_R(b,b)=a)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f,d\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\n\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(d=2k+1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{67pt}\\to\\exists r,y\\in R\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S(y,f,\\langle r\\rangle,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\n\\land y=0_R\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coordinate\\text{-}projection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,d,J)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&d,n\\in\\omega\\land d\\leq n\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(J,d,n)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in d\\;(i<j\\to J(i)<J(j))\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\pi,R^n,R^d)\n\\land\\forall x\\in R^n\\;\\forall i<d\\;(\\pi(x)(i)=x(J(i))).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\land S\\subseteq R^n\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\exists s\\in\\omega^r\\;\\exists P,D,p,\\epsilon\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PolynomialRingCarrier}_S(P,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land D=\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle:i<r\\land j<s(i)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(p,D,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\epsilon,D,3)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land S=\\bigcup_{i<r}\\bigcap_{j<s(i)}\n\\left\\{x\\in R^n:\\exists y\\in R\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\n(y,p(\\langle i,j\\rangle),x,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,n)\\\\\n{}\\land{}&\\Bigl(\n(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=0\\land y=0_R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1\\land y<_{R}0_R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(\\epsilon(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=2\\land0_R<_{R}y)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\right\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}set\\text{-}tarski\\text{-}seidenberg}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TarskiSeidenberg}_S(\\pi,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\\\\n&\\land\\exists J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n+1,n,J)\n\\land\\forall i<n\\;(J(i)=i)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\subseteq R^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n+1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{55pt}\\to\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(\\pi[A],R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}real\\text{-}closed\\text{-}field\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RealClosedField}_S(R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coordinate\\text{-}projection\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,n,d,J\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&X=R^n\\land Y=R^d\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,d,J)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S\n(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semialgebraic\\text{-}dimension}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SemialgebraicDimension}_S(d,S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S(S,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,<_{R},n)\\\\\n&\\land d=\\max\\Bigl\\{k\\leq n:\\exists\\pi,J\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S(\\pi,R,n,k,J)\\\\\n&\\hspace{120pt}\\land\n\\operatorname{int}^{R^k}_{\\tau_{R^k}}(\\pi[S])\\neq\\varnothing\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R^{n+1}\\to R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R_{\\mathrm{an}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S","display":false}],"bytes":6990,"backlinks":[{"id":"b4bc98f86309d2d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Semialgebraic}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md]])"},{"id":"a57ed68f4a891fa9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RealClosedStructure}_S$, the five-place $\\mathrm{CoordinateProjection}_S$, and the eight-place $\\mathrm{Semialgebraic}_S$ are the structure-explicit predicates from [[58-df-semialgebraic-set]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-semialgebraic-set.md|58-df-semialgebraic-set]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","00787d1ad50fa75c","36d7463d215be751","3df866ee4574e842"]}